                                                "sense_id": "bbed2722-9a85-3cc9-b5fc-b747a351b441",
                                                "text": "He was taught the legends of the Mess Plate, from the great grinning Golden Gods that had come out of the Summer Palace in Pekin to the silver-mounted markhor-horn snuff-mull presented by the last C.O. (he who spake to the seven subalterns)."
                                            }
                                        ]
